false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":6,"created_at":"2025-01-14T11:08:59Z","updated_at":"2026-02-07T12:37:19Z","closed_at":"2025-03-13T14:04:11Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101533","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101533","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101533.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101533.patch","merged_at":"2025-03-13T14:04:11Z"},"body":"Improve performance for drawing the 4 circles in the capsule gizmo.\r\n\r\nSame technique [as for the navigation gizmo](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101424).\r\nDoing what was was suggested by @Calinou [here](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101424#issuecomment-2585348440).\r\n\r\nDid some benchmarking using rdtsc ( actual cycles count ) for the generation of all the points for the capsule (averaged over 3000 iterations of the function): \r\n|  Implementation     | Cycles|\r\n| -------- | ------- |\r\n| Old | 156 000    |\r\n| New (same point count) | 18 500  ( x8.4 )   |\r\n| New (less points) | 5 750  ( x27 )  |\r\n\r\nI added a less point comparison in there (10 points per octant instead of 45), because I visually cannot see a difference between the two, we start seeing a difference for a capsule that is really huge. I left it at 45 for now, to not have any visual changes, but I do think we can lower this number.\r\n\r\nLots of other places in this file where we can use the same technique, but I wanted to see if this gets merged first.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","g